  "summary": "Extracts legacy wallet migration methods and the public MigrateLegacyToDescriptor routines out of wallet/wallet.cpp into dedicated wallet/migration.{h,cpp} files. Relocates wallet path and persistent startup setting helper functions to wallet/walletutil.{h,cpp}. Renames wallet/migrate.{h,cpp} to wallet/legacybdb.{h,cpp} to clarify that it handles legacy Berkeley DB storage rather than general migration logic.",
  "problem": "wallet/wallet.cpp exceeds 4,500 lines and commingles legacy BDB migration logic with core descriptor wallet operations, making the primary wallet implementation difficult to read, maintain, and reason about.",
