    "PR description: 'It has been noted by many developers that the wallet/wallet.cpp file is quite hard to reason about. It is more than 4500 lines long currently and this patch is an attempt to shortern it by around 800 lines by extracting out the wallet migration code into a dedicated wallet/migration.cpp file.'",
    "PR description: 'moves the legacy wallet stuff from the main wallet file that paves the way for it being descriptor specific (as much as possible), and makes legacy wallet migration code a first-class citizen in its own file.'"
